1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,360
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,720
=The One=

16
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 1=

17
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,399
(Su Yan)

18
00:00:36,399 --> 00:00:37,039
(Su Yan, partner at Xincheng Law Firm)
(Come on.)

19
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,920
(I was just fooling around.)

20
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,880
(I only slept with a few women.)

21
00:00:40,799 --> 00:00:41,880
(After ten years together,)

22
00:00:42,479 --> 00:00:43,640
(you're dumping me over this?)

23
00:00:51,359 --> 00:00:52,520
Hey, gorgeous.

24
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:53,920
All alone?

25
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,880
Aw, must be lonely.

26
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,479
Want the two of us

27
00:00:58,679 --> 00:00:59,799
to show you a good time?

28
00:01:04,079 --> 00:01:05,280
Under the law,

29
00:01:05,959 --> 00:01:07,079
groping someone

30
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,719
can land you in jail for up to 15 days.

31
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:10,840
So...

32
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:13,920
get lost.

33
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:15,920
Ooh, I'm terrified.

34
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:17,359
Come on. Let's go somewhere private.

35
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,040
Have a drink with us.

36
00:01:19,719 --> 00:01:20,560
Did she say yes?

37
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:37,040
(Cheng Lin, part-time bartender)

38
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:42,719
Su Yan.

39
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:44,519
You're okay now.

40
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,959
Why are you here all alone?

41
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,199
Do you have a girlfriend?

42
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:09,759
No.

43
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:13,960
You do now.

44
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:16,680
Su Yan.

45
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,439
Don't you remember me?

46
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:35,599
Never kissed anyone?

47
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:37,639
Mm.

48
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:39,879
I-I can learn.

49
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,120
My ex.

50
00:03:00,919 --> 00:03:01,639
You mind?

51
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:32,800
(Duan Cizhou)

52
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:39,919
Don't tell me you don't know

53
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,800
how to use this either.

54
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,400
You're a quick learner.

55
00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:17,600
(Su Yan's Home)

56
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,240
These are new.

57
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:26,000
Put them on and go.

58
00:04:28,839 --> 00:04:29,480
Whose are they?

59
00:04:31,279 --> 00:04:32,120
My ex's.

60
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,560
But I don't need them anymore.

61
00:04:35,439 --> 00:04:36,000
They're new.

62
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:36,959
He never wore them.

63
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:39,360
You're upset

64
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:41,040
because of him, aren't you?

65
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,439
If you can't do it,

66
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,680
don't force it.

67
00:05:09,279 --> 00:05:10,120
Got an account?

68
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,839
I've got WeChat. Add me.

69
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:16,920
From now on,

70
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,079
if you want to see me,

71
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,319
just call. I'll be there.

72
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:26,040
(Cheng Lin)

73
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,079
One thing about me:

74
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,160
I prefer to keep things simple.

75
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,600
I hope you do too.

76
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,319
Is 50,000 yuan enough?

77
00:05:33,319 --> 00:05:34,319
(Payment received: 50,000 yuan)

78
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,240
(Su Yan! Su Yan!)

79
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:39,399
(Open the door!)

80
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:43,600
Now

81
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,600
you can go.

82
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:06,880
=The One=

83
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:21,520
(Su Yan.)

84
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,720
(Tell me.)

85
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,320
(What would make you feel better?)

86
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:29,720
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

87
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:33,240
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

88
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:36,760
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

89
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:40,520
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

90
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:59,000
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

91
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:02,640
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

92
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:05,840
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

93
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:09,520
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

94
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:12,920
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

95
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:16,600
♪I hum this song alone♪

96
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:20,440
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

97
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:24,520
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

98
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:27,800
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

99
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:31,400
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

100
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:34,880
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

101
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:39,760
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
